        <p><b>Scryfall.</b> Card images, and data for cards outside the bundled set, come from <a href="https://scryfall.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Scryfall</a>. Project Commander is not produced by or endorsed by Scryfall. Card artwork belongs to its artists and Wizards of the Coast.</p>
